      "when": "m*q < 0 && m + q != 0 && abs(m*q) <= 60",
      "stem": "若 x²＋kx−{abs(m*q)}＝(x＋a)(x{q > 0 ? '＋' : '−'}{abs(q)})，a 是整數，則 k＝？",
      "answer": "m+q",
      "check": {
        "type": "value",
        "expr": "{negP(m*q)}÷{negP(q)}+{negP(q)}"
      },
      "okfb": "正確！a×{negP(q)}＝{sgn(m*q)}，a＝{sgn(m)}；k＝{sgn(m)}＋{negP(q)}＝{sgn(m+q)}。",
      "hint": "(x＋a)(x{q > 0 ? '＋' : '−'}{abs(q)}) 乘開：常數項是 a×{negP(q)}，一次項係數是 a＋{negP(q)}。",
      "distractors": [
        "CX02",
        "CX01",
        "CX03"
      ],
      "pick": 3
    }
